  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 Wound</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 30 spaces</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 5-space-radius</p><p>You become a comet of Black Flame, charging into melee with a deafening burst of energy.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>30 spaces</strong> which you have line of sight to. You immediately <strong>Charge</strong> to that target, and gain <strong>bonus dice</strong> on the attack check equal to your <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Metaphysics</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check. Creatures within a<strong> 5-space-radius</strong> of your final destination must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or become <strong>Deafened</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p>",
